<title>USA: GMAC files for $2 bln mortgage shelf.</title>
<headline>GMAC files for $2 bln mortgage shelf.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>GMAC Commercial Mortgage Securities Inc said Monday it filed a shelf registration with the Securities and Exchange Commission to sell up to $2 billion in mortgage pass-through certificates.</p>
<p>When combined with previous registrations, GMAC will have a total offering of $2,543,263,650 in pass-through certificates available for sale, the filing said.  </p>
<p>Net proceeds will be applied by GMAC to the purchaser of trust assets or will be used by GMAC for general corporate purposes, the filing said.</p>
</text>
